# Pasting several lines into a new empty block replaces it with the pasted blocks, keeping their nesting.
file <<END
Shopping:
	- Milk
END
see Milk
keys j o
paste <<END
- Eggs
- Butter
	- salted
- Jam
END
see - Jam
status NAVIGATE
quit
saved <<END
Shopping:
	- Milk
	- Eggs
	- Butter
		- salted
	- Jam
END
